rId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"노포트 구는 돌아올 거야. 노포트 구 사람도 여전히 있으니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"모건","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"우리 생활도…… 돌아오겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"모건","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"우리는 그냥…… 참으면 돼. 조금만 더 참으면 돼."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"모건","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"비나, 난……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"모건","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"전쟁은 끝날 거야, 그렇지?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["켈시"]}]}
